| 2 | **NH Collection Roma Palazzo Cinquecento** | €195 | 4.5 | 0.4 km | Free Wi‑Fi, fitness centre, on‑site restaurant, 24‑h concierge | Credit card, PayPal, Apple Pay, local bank transfer |
| 3 | **Hotel De' Ricci** | €180 | 4.6 | 0.5 km | Free Wi‑Fi, wine bar, breakfast, 24‑h reception | Credit card, PayPal, Apple Pay, local bank transfer |
| 4 | **Hotel Colosseo** | €165 | 4.3 | 0.6 km | Free Wi‑Fi, breakfast, 24‑h reception | Credit card, PayPal, Apple Pay, local bank transfer |
