> **Why these hotels?**  
> • All are within 1 km of the Colosseum, so you’ll be able to walk to the main attractions.  
> • Prices are based on the 10‑day stay (Dec 10 – Dec 20) and include taxes.  
> • Ratings are from the latest user reviews (average 4.2–4.7).  
> • Payment options are the same for every property in the Rome area – major credit cards, PayPal, Apple Pay, and local bank transfer.

